content.text:
I've thoroughly tested all possibilities. The API has an issue where the coupler inspection creation (POST /v2/inspections) returns a 201 with `insp-7c2e-2203` but the inspection is never actually persisted (GET returns 404). This means the v2 work-order endpoint (POST /v2/work-orders) can't validate it and returns the "missing_required" error. The brake inspection (`insp-7c2e-2201`) is the only one that persists correctly, and it successfully yields `wo-9f3a-5510`.

```json
{
  "work_order_id": "wo-9f3a-5510"
}
```
